{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stateStream","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"bufferingPolicy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StateStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/StateStream"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Continuation","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"BufferingPolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV15BufferingPolicyO"},{"text":" = .unbounded) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StateStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/StateStream"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"bufferingPolicy","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"How states are buffered until they are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumed. By default all of them, without any limit. A consumer only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"interested in where the state machine is now, and not in the states"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it passed on the way, can use "},{"code":".bufferingNewest(1)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A new stream of states, starting with the current state.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The current state is delivered at once, so a stream tells where the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"state machine is whenever it is created. This makes it a good fit for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a user interface. To know how a state was entered, or to not miss any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transition, use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transitionStream"},{"text":" instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A transition leading back to the same state delivers the state again.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A rejected event delivers nothing, as the state machine stays where it is.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every call creates a new stream, independent of all other streams.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Several consumers can each have a stream of their own, and all of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them get every state. Cancelling the task of a consumer, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"letting go of a stream, ends only that stream.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The stream finishes when the state machine reaches an ending state,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after delivering that state. A stream created at an ending state","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivers the state and finishes. The stream also finishes if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"state machine is deallocated.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/statestream(bufferingpolicy:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine","doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MiamiStateMachine"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C11stateStream15bufferingPolicyScSyq_GScS12ContinuationV09BufferingG0Oyq___G_tF","title":"stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StateMachineEvent"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"State"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hashable"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"State"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Context"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}]},"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stateStream","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"bufferingPolicy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama","text":"StateStream","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV","text":"Continuation","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV15BufferingPolicyO","text":"BufferingPolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama","text":"StateStream","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"MiamiStateMachine"},"abstract":[{"text":"Creates a stream of the states the state machine is at. It starts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the current state, followed by the state entered by every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transition made from now on, in the order they are made.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StateMachine","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StateMachine","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"StateMachine","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A state machine is an actor with a current state and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a set of transitions defining the machine. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TransitionRule"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connects two states by an event trigger."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine","role":"symbol"},"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine/StateStream":{"url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/statestream","kind":"symbol","title":"StateMachine.StateStream","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StateStream","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StateStream","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A stream of the states a state machine is at, one after the other.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/StateStream"},"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine/stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/statestream(bufferingpolicy:)","title":"stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)","c